    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;UP&quot;</strong> is a fast-paced platformer that challenges your reflexes, jumping skills, climbing ability, and quick decision-making. In this vertical world filled with towering structures and dangerous platforms, you have only one goal: <strong>go up</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With mechanics that are easy to learn but hard to master, UP delivers a sense of growth and mastery step by step. Whether you're a speedrunner or a strategic thinker, you'll face increasingly difficult challenges as you climb. Timing, direction, and jump angles will determine your success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Reflex-Based Parkour Mechanics</strong><br>Fast and fluid movement system including jumping, platforming, and quick navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Endless Ascent in a Vertical World</strong><br>Each level pushes you higher. How far can you climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Deadly Traps and Challenging Obstacles</strong><br>Watch your step! Hidden traps and moving platforms will test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Minimalist and Aesthetic Design</strong><br>Clean yet striking visuals keep you focused on the atmosphere and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready? Jump, climb, ascend... and never fall. Because in this world, there\u2019s only one way: UP.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;UP&quot;</strong> is a fast-paced platformer that challenges your reflexes, jumping skills, climbing ability, and quick decision-making. In this vertical world filled with towering structures and dangerous platforms, you have only one goal: <strong>go up</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With mechanics that are easy to learn but hard to master, UP delivers a sense of growth and mastery step by step. Whether you're a speedrunner or a strategic thinker, you'll face increasingly difficult challenges as you climb. Timing, direction, and jump angles will determine your success.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Reflex-Based Parkour Mechanics</strong><br>Fast and fluid movement system including jumping, platforming, and quick navigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Endless Ascent in a Vertical World</strong><br>Each level pushes you higher. How far can you climb?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Deadly Traps and Challenging Obstacles</strong><br>Watch your step! Hidden traps and moving platforms will test your reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Minimalist and Aesthetic Design</strong><br>Clean yet striking visuals keep you focused on the atmosphere and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready? Jump, climb, ascend... and never fall. Because in this world, there\u2019s only one way: UP.</strong></p>",
